// Per channel: thenVal where condition > 0.5, else elseVal. The threshold
// was 0 until Figure 13, whose condition is hsv-to-rgb of noise: that is
// never negative, so a 0 threshold made the whole embossed branch a
// constant. 0.5 is the middle of the 0...1 color range; Figure 10's
// (if x 10.7 y) scores the same either way.
node "if"(condition, thenVal, elseVal) {
	return select(elseVal, thenVal, condition > float3(0.5))
}
